# ═════════ STEP 4B — Speed check on this GPU  (≈5–10 min the first time; seconds afterwards) ═════════
# Times a few training updates and evaluation forecasts for every architecture that still has work
# to do, then prints how many GPU hours / 5-hour sessions each priority group needs.
