# Each model is timed PROFILE_REPEATS times in a shuffled order (100 timed forecasts after 20 warm-up runs
# each time), so one slow repeat (GPU clock ramp-up, another process) cannot decide the table.
# Timing depends on the architecture only, so one seed-2024 checkpoint per architecture is used.
